d it because  that they might be able to figure it out  but someone came into my dressing room  at the end of the day  on the last day and was like do you want  this and i said yes i said put it in  your bag right now  and i will leave the room and i said  okay so  i i uh i i guess i stole that  matthew lewis may be the actor who  walked away with the most from the films  while this next prop he stole may seem a  little strange it's hard to believe he  even pulled it off  while filming the goblet of fire he took  a piece from the triwizard tournament  maze  little did we know that while the  tri-wizard champions were busy fighting  voldemort matthew lewis  was looking for a piece of the  tournament he could keep to himself  we mentioned zoe wanamaker was alan  rickman's co-conspirator in stealing  hogwarts letters but she also walked  away with a few items herself  she managed to swipe t-shirts and a  stunt person hat that she  wore while doing her own stunts while  she said she still does have some of the  letters  she hasn't mentioned whether or not she  sold a few like her pal alan  the harry potter cast has been adamant  that stealing wands from the set was  near impossible but for actor kieran  hines it was the easiest part of playing  aberforth  he claims he stole more than three dozen  wands from the harry potter set as well  as a pair of purple socks  it may seem a little bit morbid but  oliver phelps says he was able to steal  his prosthetic ear from deathly hallows  and even still has it framed in his home  because there were so many he just put  it on a napkin after filming one night  and left set  it may be just an ear but ivana lynch  got pretty jealous when she found out he  got to take home  his prosthetic and she wasn't allowed to  keep hers  apparently people have been hiding them  that's awful  oh it's all good fun this cast was on  the set of films that were full of some  of the best props the film industry  could offer  but couldn't touch any of 